 ],
 "notes": "The dead letter queue and both CloudWatch alarms are gated behind non-dev conditions (Environment defaults to 'dev'), so they are checked as __declared__ capabilities (the DLQ as a gated SQS queue; alarms by metric: ApproximateAgeOfOldestMessage for old messages, any *NumberOfMessages* metric (visible/sent/received) for DLQ activity). Declared resources carry no refs, so the DLQ-activity alarm is not tied to the DLQ specifically and the redrive wiring (which resolves to NoValue under the dev default) is not checked. PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: 'with SNS alerts for alarm notifications' - the GT creates no SNS topic; alarm actions import an external topic ARN via Fn::ImportValue (BuildNotificationStackName-WarningAlertsTopicArn). Only 'alarm actions are configured' is checked, not an SNS topic resource."
}